## Model card

- **Name:** Iceman
- **Short description:** OpenCode's anonymous stealth reasoning model (262K/131K context, Free) available on OpenCode Console and Go; measured on StealthMark 1.8.10 with active tool calling.
- **Provider / access:** OpenCode Console (`opencode/iceman-free`), OpenCode Go subscription. Endpoint: `https://opencode.ai/inference/openai/v1/chat/completions`. Free during preview period (data retained for training).
- **Release / knowledge:** Release date not publicly specified; "measured on StealthMark 1.8.10"; knowledge cutoff not publicly specified.
- **IDs:** `opencode/iceman-free` (OpenCode Console/Go); no free ID on OpenRouter or OpenCode Zen outside Console.
- **Context window:** 262,144 input / 131,072 output (per meta.json and OpenCode Console)
- **Modalities:** Text in; text out; reasoning; tool calling (active tool calling per meta.json)
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-11):** Free during preview period (prompts and completions retained for model training). No paid tier publicly listed.
- **Architecture:** Proprietary stealth model from OpenCode/Anomaly; parameter count not disclosed.

